    "observed": "Contributor 360s Jun 2019 (photo 001/003, SSE): grey-green corrugated gable end with a raised ridge monitor (tenant sign not copied), 12-pane window, AC unit, single door, full-width timber deck under an open lattice pergola with lattice screens, B3 abutting at the E; photo 032 (NNW): dark-green corrugated wall, steel double door, multi-pane upper windows, louvre near the W end.",
